We raised our children pretty much according to Harry's description above,
and we are quite happy with they way they turned out.  But then we aren't
Extropians.  Extropians may not have any good reasons for having children. 
I think it is a bad idea to have children and expect them to be like you
rather than to be like themselves.  To the extent that they do become like
